Package: shreeos-tools
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: apt, coreutils, dpkg, grep, hostname, iproute2,
 mawk | gawk, procps, sed, systemd, util-linux
Maintainer: ShreeOS Project <shreeos@example.invalid>
Description: ShreeOS system information and health diagnostics
 Debian-native utilities for inspecting the running ShreeOS system. They use
 Debian package, systemd and NetworkManager interfaces and do not replace or
 modify the system package manager, init system, or network stack.
